From a20ab51bd8a6b3b8242ba15ad5ec2ad4c77c9051 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: spartanz51 <a.m@tuta.com>
Date: Thu, 24 Sep 2026 12:02:00 +0200
Subject: [PATCH] [sdk] Load list elements by id in batches

Adds EntityClient::load_multiple and its typed CryptoEntityClient
counterpart: list elements by id, 100 per request, like TS
EntityRestClient.loadMultiple. The result follows the server's order;
ids the server does not return are omitted. Only list element types are
supported. Avoids one request per element when a caller needs many
known ids from one list.
---
 tuta-sdk/rust/sdk/src/crypto_entity_client.rs |  14 ++
 tuta-sdk/rust/sdk/src/entity_client.rs        | 149 +++++++++++++++++-
 2 files changed, 162 insertions(+), 1 deletion(-)

